---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import screenshot from '../../../screenshots/slint-captured.png';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout title="Real-time buffer performance">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">CLAP / VST3 · AUDIO EFFECT</p>
    <h1>Make the next beat<br /><em>hit differently.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">Catch a slice. Flip it, pitch it, wear it down. Sixteen momentary pads turn your audio into a hands-on performance.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`${base}/downloads/`}>Get Buffer Uppercut</a><a class="text-link" href={`${base}/installation/`}>How to use it ↗</a></div>
    <p class="muted">In development. Preview downloads will be clearly labeled unsigned.</p>
  </section>
  <figure class="product"><img src={screenshot.src} width={screenshot.width} height={screenshot.height} alt="Buffer Uppercut native editor with sixteen performance pads, effect macro knobs and a captured audio waveform" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>The native editor. Your audio, under your fingers.</figcaption></figure>
  <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="Features">
    <article><p class="eyebrow">01 / CAPTURE</p><h2>Play the buffer.</h2><p>Beat Repeat, Reverse and Tape Stop reshape recent audio. Each buffer slot keeps its own eight-second stereo history.</p></article>
    <article><p class="eyebrow">02 / TRANSFORM</p><h2>Stack your sound.</h2><p>Grain Pitch, Gate, Filter, LoFi and Vinyl. Hold up to six active processors in a predictable slot-order chain.</p></article>
    <article><p class="eyebrow">03 / PERFORM</p><h2>Keep it hands-on.</h2><p>Trigger pads with MIDI, the mouse or automation. Enable DIRECT KEYS for the physical 1234 / QWER / ASDF / ZXCV layout.</p></article>
  </section>
</Layout>
